	[[Compliment his childish underwear|Carter Gym Undie Complement]] <span style="color:Green">+Carter</span><br>
	[[Make fun of his childish underwear|Carter Gym Undie Make Fun]] <span style="color:Red">-Carter</span><br>
<</if>>

